# Word list

`WordsList.vue` shows the word chips. Opening a chip sets `showVerses` and covers the list with `.verses-panel` (`position: absolute; inset: 0`). Do not remove that overlay.

Clicking the header title (`header-title`) sets `showVerses` false, same as the verse pill.

Clicking تحليل الجذر or تحليل الحروف must not close the verses. Do not put the close handler on the header row.

`.words-list-header` is `pointer-events: none` so it does not block the pill. The title and `.v-btn` set `pointer-events: auto`.

On screens under 600px, `.header-actions` wraps onto its own line so the buttons sit under the title and do not cover the verse pill.
